    "name": {
      "value": "The Beating"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "sf2"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "_The Beating_ symbolizes attack from all sides. If you have _The Beating_ invested, whenever you and an ally are flanking a foe, your melee Strikes gain a +2 item bonus to damage. This increases to a +3 item bonus at 17th level.\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou wave the card to conjure up dozens of violent ghostly figures; you cast pernicious poltergeist, and the area of the spell is treated as difficult terrain in addition to its normal effects. The level of the spell is one-half your level, rounded down (minimum 6th level), and the save DC is your class DC."
    },
